 "remarks": "This updated 1-bedroom plus den at Rolling Ridge gives you space you'll actually use. The den works well as a home office, guest room, or flex space, and has its own half bath, alongside a fully updated primary bath. The renovated kitchen features brand-new appliances, tile, and quartz countertops. Sliders off the dining room open to your own private balcony. The unit is just one short flight up from the building entrance and includes extra storage. Rolling Ridge sits on park-like grounds with an in-ground pool, paddle courts, and a pond, and offers plenty of unassigned parking for residents and guests. Heat and hot water are included in the HOA fee, and the community is professionally managed with an active board. Close to local shopping, the train, and major highways.",
